## Code Style

- Don't fix something at random, first do some logging if there isn't enough information to clearly identify the problem.
- NO Russian text in code or comments
- Keep files compact (max 300 lines, excluding imports)
- Use `remember { FocusRequester() }` in Compose, not inline creation
- NEVER use `runBlocking` on EDT! Use `launch`, `async`, or sync calls
